' INFO and the statistics by keys (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start
' 30 party`: the companion camped at Paradise Camp, a prepared state). R opens
' INFO; Left takes the next production (maggots, by choice) and Right the
' previous — here back to automatic (`NextProduction`, `PreviousProduction`;
' v1.2 has Left for the next); Down and Up scroll its list; Escape closes it.
' H opens the statistics; Q does nothing there, Space closes them
' (`StatisticsScene`: Primary or Back).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
press down               ' the keyboard
press r                  ' INFO
wait 3
press left               ' maggots, by choice
press right              ' automatic again
press down
press up
press escape             ' closed
wait 3
press h                  ' the statistics
wait 3
press q                  ' nothing
press space              ' closed
wait 3
quit
